{
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FBFCFD\\,#F3F5F8)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#171A1E\\,#1C1F26)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "{brand.y}+({brand.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#1C3F7A|#91AEE8",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "brand",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "21.0pt",
        "y": "11pt",
        "w": "-1",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[if::(eq::(${kd},2),${@i18n.b2},if::(eq::(${kd},3),${@i18n.b3},if::(eq::(${kd},4),${@i18n.b4},${@i18n.b1})))]",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "_note": "卡名随组件的类型参数(长按编辑可换):全部 / 8-K / 财报 / 内部人。源身份由左边那颗源色点承担。"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "14pt",
        "w": "134.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${at}",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
      },
      {
        "id": "tk",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "36pt",
        "w": "-1",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${rows[0].k},--)]",
        "fontSize": "22pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "hide": "$[if::(eq::(${st},2),1,if::(eq::(${st},3),1,0))]"
      },
      {
        "id": "fm",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "{tk.r}+7pt",
        "y": "38pt",
        "w": "-1",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${rows[0].f}",
        "fontSize": "10pt",
        "textColor": "#1C3F7A|#91AEE8",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "bgColor": "#1F1C3F7A|#2991AEE8",
        "paddingLeft": "6.0pt",
        "paddingRight": "6.0pt",
        "paddingTop": "2.5pt",
        "paddingBottom": "2.5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "9.5pt",
          "leftB": "9.5pt",
          "rightT": "9.5pt",
          "rightB": "9.5pt"
        },
        "hide": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${rows[0].f}),0),if::(eq::(${st},2),1,if::(eq::(${st},3),1,0)),1)]",
        "_note": "类型胶囊(8-K / 10-Q …):宽度随文案,x 锚在代码右边缘。一个 txt 节点自带底(§4.2a-2)。"
      },
